TITLE NH4+ vs NH3 at 150C (Simple)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5

SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file output_simple.sel
    -molalities NH4+ NH3
    -pH

END
